Privacy Policy for ClipMagic
Effective Date: August 10, 2025

ClipMagic (“the Extension”) is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information is collected, how it is used, and how it is safeguarded.

1. Information We Collect
The Extension does not collect personally identifiable information (PII) such as your name, email, address, or any other personal details.

The only data processed is:

Website Content You Select: Text you manually highlight and choose to save using the extension’s features.

Extension Settings: Preferences such as saved snippets, favorites, custom hotkeys, and layout choices.

2. How We Use Your Data
The selected text and preferences are stored locally on your device using Chrome’s storage API.

This data is never sent to external servers, shared with third parties, or used for advertising.

Host permissions (<all_urls>) are used only to enable snippet capture from any webpage at the user’s request.

3. Permissions and Justifications
storage: Save snippets, favorites, and preferences locally in your browser.

activeTab: Capture text from the currently active page when you trigger a save action.

scripting: Inject code to collect the highlighted text and display the floating favorites panel.

contextMenus: Add a right-click menu to save selected text.

Host permissions (<all_urls>): Allow snippet saving from any site you visit.

We request these permissions solely to fulfill the single purpose of the Extension—capturing and organizing text snippets.

4. No Remote Code
The Extension does not load, execute, or depend on code from remote sources. All scripts are packaged within the extension and reviewed before release.

5. Data Sharing
We do not:

Sell or transfer your data to third parties.

Use your data for purposes unrelated to the extension’s functionality.

Use or transfer your data for determining creditworthiness or lending purposes.

6. Security
Since your saved snippets and settings never leave your local device, they are protected by your browser’s security model.

7. Changes to This Policy
If changes are made to this Privacy Policy, the updated version will be posted at the same URL with a revised effective date
